# CV PDFs. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC -- a CV committed here is a name, an email
# address, a phone number and an employment history published forever. Only the
# derived profile (scout/profiles/<id>.json: skills, role_titles, source) is
# ever committed.
data/cv/
data/sent_jobs.json
data/uploads/
data/dashboard.html
data/dashboards/
